cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite both the software and the paper it accompanies."
title: "Critical mineral pathfinder targeting in the Aravalli basement: analysis code"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for the study that matches north-west Indian and Western Australian
  stream-sediment catchments on weathering-robust provenance ratios, tests whether critical
  mineral pathfinder element signatures transfer between the matched catchments, and scores the
  Aravalli catchments with the signatures that transfer.
type: software
